                                               rdfs:range <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AngleDegrees> ;
                                               rdfs:comment "Extinction angle. It is used to limit the dc voltage at the inverter if needed. Typical value between 17 degrees and 20 degrees for an inverter. It is converters state variable result from power flow. The attribute shall be a positive value." ;
                                               rdfs:label "gamma"@en .


