                                                     rdfs:range <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AngleDegrees> ;
                                                     rdfs:comment "Target extinction angle. It is converters control variable used in power flow. It is only applicable for inverter if continuous tap changer control is used. Allowed values are within the range minGammalttargetGammaltmaxGamma. The attribute shall be a positive value." ;
                                                     rdfs:label "targetGamma"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CsConverter.targetIdc
