                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Measurement> ;
                                                rdfs:range <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseCode> ;
                                                rdfs:comment "Indicates to which phases the measurement applies and avoids the need to use measurementType to also encode phase information which would explode the types. The phase information in Measurement along with measurementType and phases uniquely defines a Measurement for a device based on normal network phase. Their meaning will not change when the computed energizing phasing is changed due to jumpers or other reasons.If the attribute is missing three phases ABC shall be assumed." ;
                                                rdfs:label "phases"@en .


