                                                          rdfs:range <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Money> ;
                                                          rdfs:comment "Cumulative total of transacted amounts during this shift. Values are obtained from transactionsumTransaction.transactionAmount. It also has to be reconciled against transaction summarysumTransactionSummary.transactionsTotal." ;
                                                          rdfs:label "transactionsGrandTotal"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Shift.transactionsGrandTotalRounding
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Shift.transactionsGrandTotalRounding> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
