                                          rdfs:comment "Phase of this energy consumer component.   If the energy consumer is wye connected the connection is from the indicated phase to the central ground or neutral point.  If the energy consumer is delta connected the phase indicates an energy consumer connected from the indicated phase to the next logical nonneutral phase." ,
