                                                 rdfs:label "highStep"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TapChanger.ltcFlag
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TapChanger.ltcFlag> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                rdfs:domain <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TapChanger> ;
                                                rdfs:range xsd:boolean ;
