                                                     rdfs:comment "Provides pricing and other relevant information about a specific manufacturers product i.e. AssetModel and its price from a given supplier. A single AssetModel may be availble from multiple suppliers. Note that manufacturer and supplier are both types of organisation which the association is inherited from Document." ;
                                                     rdfs:label "AssetModelCatalogueItem"@en .


