<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BidPriceCurve> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                           rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Curve> ;
                                           rdfs:comment "Relationship between unit operating price in hour Yaxis and unit output in MW Xaxis." ;
                                           rdfs:label "BidPriceCurve"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BidPriceSchedule
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BidPriceSchedule> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RegularIntervalSchedule> ;
                                              rdfs:comment "Defines bid schedules to allow a product bid to use specified bid price curves for different time intervals." ;
                                              rdfs:label "BidPriceSchedule"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BidSelfSched
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BidSelfSched> rdf:type owl:Class ;
