                                          rdfs:label "BidSelfSched"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BidSet
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BidSet> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                    rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> ;
                                    rdfs:comment "As set of mutually exclusive bids for which a maximum of one may be scheduled.Of these generating bids only one generating bid can be scheduled at a time." ;
                                    rdfs:label "BidSet"@en .


