                                     rdfs:comment "Modified IEEE DC2A direct current commutator exciter with speed input one more leg block in feedback loop and without underexcitation limiters UEL inputs.  DC type 2 excitation system model with added speed multiplier added leadlag and voltagedependent limits." ;
                                     rdfs:label "ExcDC2A"@en .


