                                       rdfs:comment "Simplified governor." ;
                                       rdfs:label "GovSteam2"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#GovSteamBB
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#GovSteamBB> rdf:type owl:Class ;
