###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#GrossToNetActivePowerCurve
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#GrossToNetActivePowerCurve> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Curve> ;
                                                        rdfs:comment "Relationship between the generating units gross active power output on the Xaxis measured at the terminals of the machines and the generating units net active power output on the Yaxis based on utilitydefined measurements at the power station. Station service loads when modelled should be treated as nonconforming bus loads. There may be more than one curve depending on the auxiliary equipment that is in service." ;
                                                        rdfs:label "GrossToNetActivePowerCurve"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Ground
