###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#HeatInputCurve
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#HeatInputCurve> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                            rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Curve> ;
                                            rdfs:comment "Relationship between unit heat input in energy per time for main fuel Y1axis and supplemental fuel Y2axis versus unit output in active power Xaxis. The quantity of main fuel used to sustain generation at this output level is prorated for throttling between definition points. The quantity of supplemental fuel used at this output level is fixed and not prorated." ;
                                            rdfs:label "HeatInputCurve"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#HeatRate
