                                                    rdfs:label "LinearShuntCompensator"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#LinearShuntCompensatorPhase
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#LinearShuntCompensatorPhase> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                         rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ShuntCompensatorPhase> ;
