###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MaterialItem
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MaterialItem> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                          rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> ;
