                                                    rdfs:comment "MeasurementValueSource describes the alternative sources updating a MeasurementValue. User conventions for how to use the MeasurementValueSource attributes are defined in IEC 61970301." ;
                                                    rdfs:label "MeasurementValueSource"@en .


