                                                       rdfs:comment "Network model project change described by versions of an associated change set.  Has persistent identity over multiple versions of the associated change set. " ;
                                                       rdfs:label "NetworkModelProjectChange"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#NetworkModelProjectChangeVersion
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#NetworkModelProjectChangeVersion> rdf:type owl:Class ;
