                                           rdfs:comment "Set of spatial coordinates that determine a point defined in the coordinate system specified in Location.CoordinateSystem. Use a single position point instance to describe a pointoriented location. Use a sequence of position points to describe a lineoriented object physical location of nonpoint oriented objects like cables or lines or area of an object like a substation or a geographical zone  in this case have first and last position point with the same values." ;
                                           rdfs:label "PositionPoint"@en .


