                                            rdfs:comment " A sensor used mainly in overhead distribution networks as the source of both current and voltage measurements." ;
                                            rdfs:label "PostLineSensor"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PotentialTransformer
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PotentialTransformer> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Sensor> ;
                                                  rdfs:comment "Instrument transformer also known as Voltage Transformer used to measure electrical qualities of the circuit that is being protected andor monitored. Typically used as voltage transducer for the purpose of metering protection or sometimes auxiliary substation supply. A typical secondary voltage rating would be 120V." ;
                                                  rdfs:label "PotentialTransformer"@en .


