<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PowerQualityPricing> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Document> ;
                                                 rdfs:comment "Pricing can be based on power quality." ;
                                                 rdfs:label "PowerQualityPricing"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PowerSystemProjectLifecycleToBeDeleted
