                                       rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PowerSystemStabilizerDynamics> ;
                                       rdfs:comment "Power system stabilizer part of an ABB excitation system.Footnote ABB excitation systems are an example of suitable products available commercially. This information is given for the convenience of users of this document and does not constitute an endorsement by IEC of these products." ;
                                       rdfs:label "PssSTAB2A"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PssWECC
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PssWECC> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PowerSystemStabilizerDynamics> ;
