<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchOperationSummary> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                    rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> ;
                                                    rdfs:comment "Uptodate ofrecord summary of switch operation information distilled from a variety of sources realtime data or realtime data historian field inspections etc. of use to asset health analytics.  " ;
                                                    rdfs:label "SwitchOperationSummary"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchPhase
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchPhase> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                         rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PowerSystemResource> ;
                                         rdfs:comment "Single phase of a multiphase switch when its attributes might be different per phase." ;
                                         rdfs:label "SwitchPhase"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchSchedule
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchSchedule> rdf:type owl:Class ;
