###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SynchronousMachineOperatingMode
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SynchronousMachineOperatingMode> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Enumeration> ;
