                                              rdfs:label "TradingHubValues"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Transaction
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Transaction> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                         rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> ;
                                         rdfs:comment "The record of details of payment for service or token sale." ;
                                         rdfs:label "Transaction"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransactionBid
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransactionBid> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                            rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Bid> ;
                                            rdfs:comment "Bilateral or scheduled transactions for energy and ancillary services considered by market clearing process." ;
                                            rdfs:label "TransactionBid"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransactionBidClearing
