                                                                   rdfs:label "TransmissionInterfaceRightEntitlement"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransmissionModeKind
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransmissionModeKind> rdf:type owl:Class ;
