                                                  rdfs:label "TransmissionModeKind"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransmissionPath
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransmissionPath> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> ;
                                              rdfs:comment "An electrical connection link or line consisting of one or more parallel transmission elements between two areas of the interconnected electric systems or portions thereof. TransmissionCorridor and TransmissionRightOfWay refer to legal aspects. The TransmissionPath refers to the segments between a TransmissionProviders ServicePoints." ;
                                              rdfs:label "TransmissionPath"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransmissionProduct
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransmissionProduct> rdf:type owl:Class ;
