<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Tsunami> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#HydrosphericPhenomenon> ;
                                     rdfs:comment "A tsunami tidal wave a long high sea wave caused by an earthquake submarine landslide or other disturbance." ;
                                     rdfs:label "Tsunami"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TurbLCFB1
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TurbLCFB1> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                       rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TurbineLoadControllerDynamics> ;
                                       rdfs:comment "Turbine load controller model developed by WECC.  This model represents a supervisory turbine load controller that acts to maintain turbine power at a set value by continuous adjustment of the turbine governor speedload reference. This model is intended to represent slow reset outer loop controllers managing the action of the turbine governor." ;
                                       rdfs:label "TurbLCFB1"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TurbineGovernorDynamics
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TurbineGovernorDynamics> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                     rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DynamicsFunctionBlock> ;
                                                     rdfs:comment "Turbinegovernor function block whose behaviour is described by reference to a standard model font color0f0f0for by definition of a userdefined model.font" ;
