                                                           rdfs:label "TurbineLoadControllerDynamics"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TurbineLoadControllerUserDefined
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TurbineLoadControllerUserDefined> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TurbineLoadControllerDynamics> ;
