                                                     rdfs:comment "State of the usage point with respect to connection to the network." ;
                                                     rdfs:label "UsagePointConnectedKind"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#UsagePointGroup
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#UsagePointGroup> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> ;
                                             rdfs:comment "Abstraction for management of group communications within a twoway AMR system or the data for a group of related usage points. Commands can be issued to all of the usage points that belong to a usage point group using a defined group address and the underlying AMR communication infrastructure. " ;
                                             rdfs:label "UsagePointGroup"@en .


