                                                       <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#GateLogicKind> ;
                                              rdfs:comment "A logical OR operation. True when one or more input are true." ;
                                              rdfs:label "or"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#GateLogicKind.xnor
