###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MacroPeriodKind.billingPeriod
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MacroPeriodKind.billingPeriod> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                    <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MacroPeriodKind> ;
