<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketProductTypeAsReq.RU> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketProductTypeAsReq> ;
                                                       rdfs:comment "regulation up" ;
                                                       rdfs:label "RU"@en .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketProductTypeAsReq.SR
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketProductTypeAsReq.SR> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
